config UART_RISCITRY
	bool "RISCitry UART"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_RISCITRY_UART_ENABLED
	select SERIAL_HAS_DRIVER
	help
	  Memory-mapped UART of the RISCitry soft core (source/computer/uart.luc). Polling only: the
	  baud rate is fixed in hardware, and the receive interrupt (platform line 0) is not used yet.
